# Optional: curated photo providers.
#
# The app shows real photos WITHOUT any keys (it uses keyless Wikimedia images).
# Add a free key here ONLY if you want hand-picked, higher-quality photos app-wide.
# Copy this file to ".env" and fill in a value, then restart `npm run dev`.
#
# Unsplash (free, 50 req/hr): https://unsplash.com/developers
VITE_UNSPLASH_KEY=

# Pexels (free): https://www.pexels.com/api/
VITE_PEXELS_KEY=
